			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with Mountain, Output, Sky, Wind, Worker, Cocoon, Echo, and Maintain changes\n\nRoutine submodule synchronization bringing in latest changes across the application stack:\n\n1. Mountain: Simplify binary and Tauri config naming back to \"Mountain\" for binary/lib names, identifier, and productName. Remove duplicate externalBin entry and obsolete .Backup files.\n\n2. Output: Minify Configuration files (ESBuild, Plugin, Polyfill, Service configs) for production optimization. Add inline stub fallback for missing NLS files using tier 4 data:text/javascript mechanism to prevent webview 404s from falling through to SPA HTML.\n\n3. Sky: Fix NLS message loading by adding stub nls.messages.js and fixing vs/nls.js loading in NLS.astro. Fix Electron.astro worker script loading with separate inline module script tags.\n\n4. Wind/Worker: Regenerate minified ESBuild config and worker artifacts, reducing from verbose source to single-line minified output.\n\n5. Cocoon/Echo/Maintain: Submodule sync to latest extension host, task scheduler, and maintenance script changes.\n\nImpact: Build configuration simplified with clean \"Mountain\" naming. NLS loading fixed to prevent bootstrap failures. Worker scripts execute in correct order. All submodules updated to latest.",
